I. Sinameurneobebi 
 
mosaxleobis 2002 wlis aRwerisas, sa erTaSoriso praqtikis Sesabamisad, 
dakvirvebis erTeuls `Sinameurneoba~ warmoadgenda. 
2002 wlis aRweris monacemebiT, qveyanaSi 1243158 Sinameurneobaa, romelTa 
wevrebis ricxovnobam 4345686 kaci, anu qveynis mosaxleobis 99,4 procenti Seadgina. 
mosaxleobis umniSvnelo nawili (0,6 procenti) koleqtiur SinameurneobebSi cxovrobs. 
Sinameurneobis saSualo sidide Semcirda 3,9 kacidan 1970 wels 3,5 kacamde 2002 
wels, maT Soris qalaqad - 3,7-dan 3,5 kacamde da soflad - 4,1-dan 3,5 kacamde. 
saqarTveloSi mcxovreb sxvadasxva eTnikuri jgufebis SinameurneobaTa 
demografiuli Taviseburebebi vlindeba maTi saSualo sididis maCvenebelSi, romelic 
damokidebulia SinameurneobaSi bavSvebis ricxvze,  rTuli ganuyofeli ojaxebisa da 
qorwinebaSi myofTa maRal wilze. 
SinameurneobaTa saSualo sidide qalaqad da soflad Tanabaria (3,5 kaci). amave 
dros, rogorc qalaqad, ise soflad Sinameur neobaTa 80 procentze meti 5 da naklebi 
wevrisagan Sedgeba. 
yvelaze didi Sinameurneobebi  (4,1 kaci) aRiniSna aWaris ar-Si. SinameurneobaTa 
qveynis saSualo sidides odnav  sWarbobs samcxe-javaxeTis, qvemo-qarTlis da 
samegrelo-zemo svaneTis mxareTa saSualo maC venebeli (Sesabamisad, 3,6, 3,7, 3,7 kaci). 
qveynis saSualo maCvenebels CamorCeba Tbilis is, imereTis, Sida qarTlis, mcxeTa-
mTianeTis, kaxeTis, raWa-le Cxumisa da qvemo svaneTis mx areTa maCvenebeli (saSualod 
2,8–3,4 kaci). 
  
